  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "七月十九日，武昌遭遇了严重的轰炸，我只能躲在院外的空地上。",
      "output_sha256": "90554c505bed68794002f6862541bc63b5bd44c359dffdcb6f23790c299379c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.627044,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dea64926d6f45c3e1c0f00152b2306cd80a7b75e4893cb01de8273d3cbc1bc23",
        "68fdf40a035be0101f8f6c8d3ce347dfe1564c0d49603a27243c271db1c15e8f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "90554c505bed68794002f6862541bc63b5bd44c359dffdcb6f23790c299379c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "炸弹在空中发出尖锐的声音，我能感觉到它们即将落在附近，甚至可能成为目标。",
      "output_sha256": "4de48b91e7952c6af962050a1c64c2016f73176e6ba65b0b4839fa6e45cfdff4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.397377,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ea9381de032818964a3c20e34669a18301fe9b1197eaebfcd9b8967347590132"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4de48b91e7952c6af962050a1c64c2016f73176e6ba65b0b4839fa6e45cfdff4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "警报解除，回到院中，院墙及邻舍已倒；我的屋里只落下些灰土。",
      "output_sha256": "fa744601a34bf753d63e23a9d185636cf68fd74ae2d62021c269cce065cb15b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa744601a34bf753d63e23a9d185636cf68fd74ae2d62021c269cce065cb15b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大家决定搬到汉口去。",
      "output_sha256": "624fd9b421245138cc2d65106f88c0378a906f4c058181d79aedadfc94192bb2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "624fd9b421245138cc2d65106f88c0378a906f4c058181d79aedadfc94192bb2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我十分难过。",
      "output_sha256": "18d7be5aa0c41259b80d6efaee1511b25a5a483948adc7492a8d1ebfc028dce8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "18d7be5aa0c41259b80d6efaee1511b25a5a483948adc7492a8d1ebfc028dce8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这里并不是我的家，可是我十分的爱它，特别是在轰炸后。",
      "output_sha256": "2116ba887d31d134f00f7158bb4967b6727c1349d6a5e10a0c1f6a22496d78cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "2116ba887d31d134f00f7158bb4967b6727c1349d6a5e10a0c1f6a22496d78cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不论是多么不顺眼的地方，一经暴敌轰炸，便很可爱了。",
      "output_sha256": "68c304212ee3efdb2e4113fa8576cb6339168100dd78df278fae9d1b58bdd7b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "68c304212ee3efdb2e4113fa8576cb6339168100dd78df278fae9d1b58bdd7b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而我的居所又是那么的安静和宽敞。",
      "output_sha256": "807a950653a44469baca9c692c5e5631911e4f673fcce76338fdc1c40539b766",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.52179,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b2c29e3ea1b3ebc0ab9e71cf376ca66f8d93fbcfdc27a6a713e9c1e420509a64"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "807a950653a44469baca9c692c5e5631911e4f673fcce76338fdc1c40539b766",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "匆匆的卷起铺盖，不好意思落泪，可也又是一番小流亡的滋味呀。",
      "output_sha256": "a77b182bb005facdf673d784ac4da56b0135993e15906e2a6d432e15cb255525",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "a77b182bb005facdf673d784ac4da56b0135993e15906e2a6d432e15cb255525",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "由武昌迁到汉口，只是一江之隔，尚且难过；离开武汉，奔往他处，是连想也不敢想的。",
      "output_sha256": "9ef177ec882a7395379702200944bb6d2d6f8ac1787367c39ae86767ea828857",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ef177ec882a7395379702200944bb6d2d6f8ac1787367c39ae86767ea828857",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，二十六日，文艺界抗敌协会的会议决定总会迁往重庆，我不得不去！",
      "output_sha256": "3abc947608aa76f3112a91fc77c270f743e8aecb7a169a2d08b82783bf8f211e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.661313,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2b9100a7768f332d1d93ec9657dc337da49367827d7c628aad22e52314e3156b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3abc947608aa76f3112a91fc77c270f743e8aecb7a169a2d08b82783bf8f211e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "当然得尊重会中的决议，虽然我决不想走。",
      "output_sha256": "9b99c3ec459ed81e01b00c4410bd0611b69b83fe7a7403e2d2d27bb08b084382",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b99c3ec459ed81e01b00c4410bd0611b69b83fe7a7403e2d2d27bb08b084382",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "路上的苦处，到重庆后的困难，都不便预先害怕；我是舍不得武汉，特别是在大轰炸之后。",
      "output_sha256": "6dad1f1b6909b0c6afc3233643fc54343bd2f657a4cff5a7e299c14468d514f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "6dad1f1b6909b0c6afc3233643fc54343bd2f657a4cff5a7e299c14468d514f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "轰炸有什么可怕的呢？",
      "output_sha256": "be0b64a8edc2f94977c153ee8cf965a0ee373ad69f1099132b218b7ca128ed75",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.826307,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "acc33b944d3de31e6556757b6c6ebdeefc2fef341cb8bb3ef741146431428bca"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "be0b64a8edc2f94977c153ee8cf965a0ee373ad69f1099132b218b7ca128ed75",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "炸死，不过是一死；炸不死，多少在保卫大武汉的工作中尽自己一点点力量。",
      "output_sha256": "70f324a8f1b4299bcc66fafebbdf7bf29fe7febf81a93d0fc9494fafa67fcb8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "70f324a8f1b4299bcc66fafebbdf7bf29fe7febf81a93d0fc9494fafa67fcb8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "轰炸只是使人愤怒，只有日本人的愚蠢才以为我们害怕呢。",
      "output_sha256": "8f676f5cc30e8c4782b055819ee25b4d0a4c2299f8ce41d37595ba02e42ab6e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f676f5cc30e8c4782b055819ee25b4d0a4c2299f8ce41d37595ba02e42ab6e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "廿九晚还参加“文协”的招待阿特莱女士茶会，卅日夜间可就上了船。",
      "output_sha256": "a305cc27f62ac07dde9268afb2b3bcc46493f542ffdaa2c045bd8040d303a1d0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "a305cc27f62ac07dde9268afb2b3bcc46493f542ffdaa2c045bd8040d303a1d0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "走，是服从“文协”的命令；船票，是老向去买的。",
      "output_sha256": "fd077f20c1acb2b3751071b106cd82ffec1466398f589c7eafffefdeb1bf098e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd077f20c1acb2b3751071b106cd82ffec1466398f589c7eafffefdeb1bf098e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "（船票是自己掏钱，不动“文协”的一文。）",
      "output_sha256": "6bebffd77e9dd579f0f8f01577fed9541ad2d7540b5ded8e6e78a90849d14024",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "6bebffd77e9dd579f0f8f01577fed9541ad2d7540b5ded8e6e78a90849d14024",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我只尽了跟着行李，走上船去的责任。",
      "output_sha256": "d47aa663812d23a31c2175a1e9ffd247caff04f499ee393d036e45be7b8d5902",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "d47aa663812d23a31c2175a1e9ffd247caff04f499ee393d036e45be7b8d5902",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若是几天前的炸弹稍微偏离，我或许就不会踏上这条船了！",
      "output_sha256": "f76abe8bae2c604d0cb5c8cd500dfc3b6c8046a2b9052519850f24396170707f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.473116,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d55b4146196b1a0bf8731ecb2672c1928dab901e5b0a4108e6757920a79b389"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f76abe8bae2c604d0cb5c8cd500dfc3b6c8046a2b9052519850f24396170707f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，上船的感觉并没有比听着炸弹在头顶落下要好多少。",
      "output_sha256": "bc5123e5b529cfad41149f66805f624d714ad3178324258f4f2f46e9b04aebb5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.470919,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "62d02d9dc3220b5664eadf622d843ea904afef2cf22dad068f0a6bdfd9217762"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bc5123e5b529cfad41149f66805f624d714ad3178324258f4f2f46e9b04aebb5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我几乎迷失了方向，不明白自己为什么要挤在人群中。",
      "output_sha256": "e3dff201193db00d69143db4e4f7cbffdffb9418c08c2d077068c769a0989c9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.473489,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3d6061e62425f2ab4ea9847cc5135faaae4b3b11aa9b79ef0ffe35b4fadf6e38"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e3dff201193db00d69143db4e4f7cbffdffb9418c08c2d077068c769a0989c9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "家信已发了：打回老家么？",
      "output_sha256": "1ad3d91d41d742051e0bd14f109d3f673f247a5a1365cdee028405fb4cc276d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ad3d91d41d742051e0bd14f109d3f673f247a5a1365cdee028405fb4cc276d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我越去越远了！",
      "output_sha256": "36d6a896e37e7af3033d3dfa64feba453dc460187c7c6cf8cbcc9d5599178680",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "36d6a896e37e7af3033d3dfa64feba453dc460187c7c6cf8cbcc9d5599178680",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "孩子们还好吗？",
      "output_sha256": "d5e7f61fde58256fa9b18c9af72cab67e0fe60b8cea4447eca8ed7a1025375c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2fc3c12b5f67632cb4d877c526a49e850209f465fc7dafc04278a67d18f42d02"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d5e7f61fde58256fa9b18c9af72cab67e0fe60b8cea4447eca8ed7a1025375c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "还记得这两句，可是不敢多去咂摸：把家信作为例行的公事吧。",
      "output_sha256": "545cb6f5e25155f74accf588c25e8bea7e8a413fc399335bf722f6eda8cec423",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "545cb6f5e25155f74accf588c25e8bea7e8a413fc399335bf722f6eda8cec423",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "朋友们呢？",
      "output_sha256": "2fdf4645e635d83560c123f05b0625524254801f515f10ee5d81cc0aefb27290",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fdf4645e635d83560c123f05b0625524254801f515f10ee5d81cc0aefb27290",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在武汉交了许多新朋友，昨天还在一起欢笑，今晚却又要分别。",
      "output_sha256": "f9c60c3409af77904a52a30afc72739ad7569b3a64548b8b361367d804619250",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.772714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dd280f7d0a4d6bf842308c81751a64da28cf61fa32d5560b661ee57855fd79b8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f9c60c3409af77904a52a30afc72739ad7569b3a64548b8b361367d804619250",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "什么时候能再见面呢？",
      "output_sha256": "799626cfa2e0853c22a79a84e8a0da69c524fd8b548c7fc4f8b3b60b6fc804da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.511806,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d06f0e63db91ca8984351703550826f667d6eaa62b6bd324ba7af6aa47f38ea1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "799626cfa2e0853c22a79a84e8a0da69c524fd8b548c7fc4f8b3b60b6fc804da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "最后，我把最重要的放在最后：武汉的情况如何？",
      "output_sha256": "c168dffd52600009d1d547382425478ea0813801197ebd6bdcfd354ee2566c48",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.530119,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "789a9c305e86cc6d2555e0150d5167b3b11768d762019fd03b16c48b8f7d9b93"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c168dffd52600009d1d547382425478ea0813801197ebd6bdcfd354ee2566c48",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我曾告诉朋友们武汉是不会陷落的！",
      "output_sha256": "0d3ef5109f0a05970fa43001245baccdc0992fd265c3b3eb64f0043db71f5f86",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.59471,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7b18d3feacb1038728e09baaf3b7968e411b0d42a0f2d6048441d65b21713010"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0d3ef5109f0a05970fa43001245baccdc0992fd265c3b3eb64f0043db71f5f86",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这样告诉朋友们不止一次了。",
      "output_sha256": "fafbec8009d239041dc62e97ff8dfd7481f01a519c8c29131060cc39067f3058",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "fafbec8009d239041dc62e97ff8dfd7481f01a519c8c29131060cc39067f3058",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，我为什么走呢，既相信武汉不会陷落？",
      "output_sha256": "d0d7e91c1a234c5a50f0a4744cfac0d40909e92a7da236ea84f4219bfdcc0ad1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "d0d7e91c1a234c5a50f0a4744cfac0d40909e92a7da236ea84f4219bfdcc0ad1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这无可自解的矛盾，使人把舌团在口里。",
      "output_sha256": "8e78c946e5941483db1933364d68b510b227fdac3c5f320e37625b3ae004e470",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e78c946e5941483db1933364d68b510b227fdac3c5f320e37625b3ae004e470",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "身已在船上，即使万感交集，难道还不是以一走了之么？",
      "output_sha256": "6502b2a2c0f416071657b5012745bf08f78f2143c169c369ba094265573f16da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "6502b2a2c0f416071657b5012745bf08f78f2143c169c369ba094265573f16da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "岸上的灯光，射在江里，万星沉浮，动荡无定，心也随着欲碎。",
      "output_sha256": "992063406a69bd1014c8f3376b1c5965a50e4cd95e3f6000d487f49b075f0cb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "992063406a69bd1014c8f3376b1c5965a50e4cd95e3f6000d487f49b075f0cb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "别矣武汉！",
      "output_sha256": "12fc65806189a8499bf037f36f17f6e986fca70cd6a5ebb90c509b2d074dea9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "12fc65806189a8499bf037f36f17f6e986fca70cd6a5ebb90c509b2d074dea9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "由于票价昂贵，船上并没有挤满人。",
      "output_sha256": "58b0afb4541ae18bab4e7c302e4831fdd8fd08dd3aa77eb0a50c4f508d692bcc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.498736,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "687269f21f2a56b791f4c454476355ef457b009031e57d2fc725055f4c16b1f3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "58b0afb4541ae18bab4e7c302e4831fdd8fd08dd3aa77eb0a50c4f508d692bcc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是以人声去判断，简直不知有多少人，而且都发了疯。",
      "output_sha256": "d8d02799249aa7096a2cfacb574ebdf5aca8b9a0db97d4924afab1fa2040e016",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "d8d02799249aa7096a2cfacb574ebdf5aca8b9a0db97d4924afab1fa2040e016",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不知道为什么一定要这么乱嚷乱闹，莫非这就是逃亡必须有的表示么？",
      "output_sha256": "a94a0b29fa99b290fe7e90dcccf7bd8cd858be9b55a5c88d558e2142bbb8b5e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "a94a0b29fa99b290fe7e90dcccf7bd8cd858be9b55a5c88d558e2142bbb8b5e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不在路口上立着，大家便都能过去。",
      "output_sha256": "7b31d4cc415ec868601c384d2eeece56f44482d2042cdb64084d3c3ac79fa847",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "7b31d4cc415ec868601c384d2eeece56f44482d2042cdb64084d3c3ac79fa847",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是偏有许多人立在那里，自己不走，也不许别人通过。",
      "output_sha256": "ef28105eccdd4ce1b21fd2ba0f3662691953dbaef8c53d4d461588bc03a69aa7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef28105eccdd4ce1b21fd2ba0f3662691953dbaef8c53d4d461588bc03a69aa7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "等一等，大家就都能走过去；然而谁也不等，都往前拥，都开口就骂。",
      "output_sha256": "c2f411eb5a084b2aaa9fe1b8b021bb75214746f0df7158744328c37de1551077",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "c2f411eb5a084b2aaa9fe1b8b021bb75214746f0df7158744328c37de1551077",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "中国人大概不会严肃。",
      "output_sha256": "0d48f96457b03904639bdf8a4f6cd1002e82fbc103e5b1941aca2c9bd3a9d625",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d48f96457b03904639bdf8a4f6cd1002e82fbc103e5b1941aca2c9bd3a9d625",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "船上的茶房倒是显得安闲自在，酒水的价格仅为票价的五分之一，先付。",
      "output_sha256": "49f568fca62da563280ab4a46a3830cd91bb1e2d6b8da7255660f066676d0c94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.521828,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4ba92eb5bad7f2134c9a73e2d2f1efcd4774f17e5627097bdd76474d0b3af43d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "49f568fca62da563280ab4a46a3830cd91bb1e2d6b8da7255660f066676d0c94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们穿着拖鞋，托着水烟袋，坐在客厅里闲谈。",
      "output_sha256": "8f95e12afc0c6bf0ed5e4c5def0f9f7084975810d7c958afc9daa02cf5382b68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f95e12afc0c6bf0ed5e4c5def0f9f7084975810d7c958afc9daa02cf5382b68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "外国船上的茶房理应如此，他们没有国难，也没有任何责任；可羡慕的隐于舟上的生活呀！",
      "output_sha256": "673c883168fc952ec8bb27306e3d155f3313d4826c4acc7214c07b22d2358d96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "673c883168fc952ec8bb27306e3d155f3313d4826c4acc7214c07b22d2358d96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "船只有轮廓。",
      "output_sha256": "080f3710d975390d2fadbe4a5369cbb545a7a500f3375bcf68e17c1265c11324",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "080f3710d975390d2fadbe4a5369cbb545a7a500f3375bcf68e17c1265c11324",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一切零件，久已残落，决不修补，门上没柄，壶上没嘴，净桶没边沿，椅子没靠背，床前没号数，电灯没开关，……这船的轮廓要把几百条生命送到宜昌去。",
      "output_sha256": "60ffa9aa302db391d02f9054b51f4b76cd3d743a0e1accd363f80c765b19f433",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "60ffa9aa302db391d02f9054b51f4b76cd3d743a0e1accd363f80c765b19f433",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "票价昂贵；此外，所有的服务都需要加上“不”字。",
      "output_sha256": "08c845ec37711c513c9ac1265502153dbaffafe77c07eaf8fbbd9809e2d2e0aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.448333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ab29ab96257fe9679ef74fbc9a56ee34b543b7f0f8429715e485be206effaba7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "08c845ec37711c513c9ac1265502153dbaffafe77c07eaf8fbbd9809e2d2e0aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "饭无法就餐，开水也无法饮用，方便也成了问题……侮辱中国的江河与人民，岂只是日本侵略者而已？",
      "output_sha256": "a3ac6a8b87f0a5bf286cee751c0c864df351a9280eb336d7456f73e03f15d6cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.444234,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "84ac508eef2aad1f332665383b7cb5d8f2360f113828f1a6a4ec07a667169955"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a3ac6a8b87f0a5bf286cee751c0c864df351a9280eb336d7456f73e03f15d6cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，中国人却显得相对自在，舱内弥漫着浓重的鸦片烟味。",
      "output_sha256": "4952b9e5041fd9fa1e5f19db21907bfaf597c1a398350e41a176122f0ad1125f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.451804,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a74775623d47a5c58dcf7d5cdb395488bad0343a2d2481c9d47fb33f85d20cc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4952b9e5041fd9fa1e5f19db21907bfaf597c1a398350e41a176122f0ad1125f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "疏散人口，免去无谓的牺牲，就是使这些鸦片烟鬼多活几天的意思么？",
      "output_sha256": "6d0edf41e76a6d06f6d6b35c74a4c56633c2851e59e0e4e820844c65240204e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d0edf41e76a6d06f6d6b35c74a4c56633c2851e59e0e4e820844c65240204e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "鸦片烟鬼们有钱，能够坐上侮辱华人的洋船，享受着中西合璧的腐臭生活。",
      "output_sha256": "106a1e816b3806d3e45cf3879eddd4bf4a11e6d126c30db02872aca0fafa118f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.725403,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d4faeebbdbb5a13a5a78475d99cd7562f97a4bd252313a0317d5b57b7b9b329"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "106a1e816b3806d3e45cf3879eddd4bf4a11e6d126c30db02872aca0fafa118f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "谁敢来干预他们呢？",
      "output_sha256": "239adf2a23d6c00f2523e544f776647ff4525fbbba9cf23f33f205a82712604c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.723366,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c11439f54987f90d0c94c5358ad99da7097a02ec67b43838ca7940baf01c4148"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "239adf2a23d6c00f2523e544f776647ff4525fbbba9cf23f33f205a82712604c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看，那群孩子！",
      "output_sha256": "89f413ccb6238f1cd61def15cf8d55e594192e45c3aced02c1a8cc5e1b4f89a8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "89f413ccb6238f1cd61def15cf8d55e594192e45c3aced02c1a8cc5e1b4f89a8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这就是保存国家的元气么？",
      "output_sha256": "11f8e7df8b4c72aa300956a15e3e8fb930c383691fffc923c0966ac8b02b4dfc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "11f8e7df8b4c72aa300956a15e3e8fb930c383691fffc923c0966ac8b02b4dfc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "脏，瘦，皮在骨上挂着，一天到晚不是哭便是吃糖果。",
      "output_sha256": "c3e0165223adc6d68e64e1edbaf340c481973ec1f95605255adec5a2103f2b60",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "c3e0165223adc6d68e64e1edbaf340c481973ec1f95605255adec5a2103f2b60",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "鸦片烟鬼的后裔，何以安全地去后方，成为害童子的牺牲品？",
      "output_sha256": "c6a2ef8f525493aadac6b15a6db41cc928c467c7fe1a5747983dd83b54f02a7a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.550916,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b6572993e76b890b29673fb8aa31e3490e4dc82f0e6f6c6db9c6569512555a97"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c6a2ef8f525493aadac6b15a6db41cc928c467c7fe1a5747983dd83b54f02a7a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "船上没有医生。",
      "output_sha256": "3014bd5485042835648e7768360ab7999d9fe3fcc36b3843d91b4d58560c4929",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "3014bd5485042835648e7768360ab7999d9fe3fcc36b3843d91b4d58560c4929",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有人把洗脚水倒入开水桶里。",
      "output_sha256": "4343d5f2b40e7913f09264e4d31956ef6e85700b43dae52c55c3b865c7e6e51b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.845192,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d4e176bcf7bf9b758352d9dd70b09f68a6431dd5c9023ff820e0eef2e5cbaa5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4343d5f2b40e7913f09264e4d31956ef6e85700b43dae52c55c3b865c7e6e51b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我拉痢，害病的还很多呢。",
      "output_sha256": "9b0e1025c3d50f0cadfd3e193f92d1c2b4d634cadda31f515e123bad92516835",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b0e1025c3d50f0cadfd3e193f92d1c2b4d634cadda31f515e123bad92516835",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "两天内，舱里死了七个人。",
      "output_sha256": "48fbc6f43f34cefff07588ed9d57af20a07311efbcf86ca4c1f358fb2c254e1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "48fbc6f43f34cefff07588ed9d57af20a07311efbcf86ca4c1f358fb2c254e1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "买了船票的猪狗们，就喝那混了洗脚水的水吧，就这样死在舱里，外国人只在乎你们的钱。",
      "output_sha256": "f98f8acde4af6cb51e710d89f9211bcdb85589ea2a6b0b6aca26a8ed023d535a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": 0.778209,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        66
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3abb3de8c0ce0b50333cb1985727a64ffe6786de3dba6496e46b89b1d4703162"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f98f8acde4af6cb51e710d89f9211bcdb85589ea2a6b0b6aca26a8ed023d535a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大概洋船长教你们都跳下江去死，你们也不发一声吧？",
      "output_sha256": "57287645747fcb02055fe17ee98d1c34b24d728aa0abc3351234e8535b1a2b08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "57287645747fcb02055fe17ee98d1c34b24d728aa0abc3351234e8535b1a2b08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "没心去看江景。",
      "output_sha256": "21521d720e17fd1b05f54b8d3cf25fd363f07f6bcfb8877109b73529b096ecc8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "21521d720e17fd1b05f54b8d3cf25fd363f07f6bcfb8877109b73529b096ecc8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那夹岸的青山，云中的塔影，蒲上的流烟，多么美好的江山哪！",
      "output_sha256": "f7fdf968501f1b734440d3f084b3240a9a02662e5eaeb4b7761c8683653203c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "f7fdf968501f1b734440d3f084b3240a9a02662e5eaeb4b7761c8683653203c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，这是被奸污了的美妇。",
      "output_sha256": "24a01f65872feae5fa271ea3e83aab63d3d09b5db980c7953a6dfd9f357fb640",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 70,
      "source_human_sha256": "24a01f65872feae5fa271ea3e83aab63d3d09b5db980c7953a6dfd9f357fb640",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "除了将强盗们赶走，谁又有心肠去赞颂江上的清风与山间的明月呢！",
      "output_sha256": "11faaada35f023cbe21499576d3fc6b0dea8a92b0a6e8b2e0e178d7c003d698d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": 0.731261,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        71
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8009e6c27f40365fce4b0b3e3411abe24943a88e4ce58a22856043b58674732a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_ai_sha256": "11faaada35f023cbe21499576d3fc6b0dea8a92b0a6e8b2e0e178d7c003d698d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        67
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那些鸦片鬼们终日倒在床上，那些能坐着的壮士，终日围坐着麻雀桌旁，他们也无心观看美景。",
      "output_sha256": "fda422e4fb659bfe033efb4971bb1e2d6a2352d71e9db50c0e85d77b456ff470",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "fda422e4fb659bfe033efb4971bb1e2d6a2352d71e9db50c0e85d77b456ff470",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们对中国的伟大视而不见，因此也就不为中国担忧。",
      "output_sha256": "797d74fb6fd12e41b2472ce0594eb444d40632ca1b0c26fe904e72c7138a1908",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": 0.531703,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        73
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "840ffc009764bd3b623aba5831432278c2f90014c81030740b0643d674e94f5e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_ai_sha256": "797d74fb6fd12e41b2472ce0594eb444d40632ca1b0c26fe904e72c7138a1908",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        69
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "无限的青山，滚滚的长江，你们是位置在没有诗，没有热情的地方；等着听炮声吧。",
      "output_sha256": "eb64a6dfce903cb56a9fce277d4dd856024ee26d26953b28f231d064f9608cb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "eb64a6dfce903cb56a9fce277d4dd856024ee26d26953b28f231d064f9608cb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "船白天缓慢行驶，晚间停靠却没有固定地方和时间，全凭洋船长的安排。",
      "output_sha256": "bef182686a21f6c5b79097f869772c742514d8208b1130cf432fb309a7f22a01",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": 0.601021,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        75
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3b76d6f6eb0eab245f8c8a6d49dc9a176b25be222ce1df92a67d56b0f5d8a834"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bef182686a21f6c5b79097f869772c742514d8208b1130cf432fb309a7f22a01",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "领江的没有夜间开船的本领；在白天也还触到沙上而几乎搁浅了好多次，四天的工夫没离开船，船白天慢慢的走，夜间不定停在何处，不靠码头，怎能下去呢？",
      "output_sha256": "6e728375c215cfce3d90f36a178dc163bf7b7cc42e8c94edaa26e12424fda456",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e728375c215cfce3d90f36a178dc163bf7b7cc42e8c94edaa26e12424fda456",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只好闻着鸦片烟味，听着牌声，看着那群死尸，喝着不开而且搀了洗脚水的水。",
      "output_sha256": "3a024667e4ec71af1d392722dc1edaaa8c9b1c0aa4e429d20bb4b33d0050170b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a024667e4ec71af1d392722dc1edaaa8c9b1c0aa4e429d20bb4b33d0050170b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "就是这样，我到了宜昌。",
      "output_sha256": "2e0f1a149162a38964f11f3385c602dad9a328b4220a463592a07f839a3b324b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 78,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e0f1a149162a38964f11f3385c602dad9a328b4220a463592a07f839a3b324b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "痢疾更重了。",
      "output_sha256": "891f9ee156bb34573e8ecc5bc89daf812a934ec125b8a2347b537c10d283df91",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 79,
      "source_human_sha256": "891f9ee156bb34573e8ecc5bc89daf812a934ec125b8a2347b537c10d283df91",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 79,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "茶房又来要小账；预先付过的大概是算了。",
      "output_sha256": "8ae3c3e5a6362467ae62cfb990714df17d85f59f0481ee95f3caa2403a65696a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 76,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 80,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ae3c3e5a6362467ae62cfb990714df17d85f59f0481ee95f3caa2403a65696a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 80,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "松懈，肮脏，怯懦的流亡，啊！",
      "output_sha256": "136d1a7453d2c0856f36542cc274e38ce7ade428c1674bbf637e13cadfa5a05a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 77,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 81,
      "source_human_sha256": "136d1a7453d2c0856f36542cc274e38ce7ade428c1674bbf637e13cadfa5a05a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 81,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "难道还需要到别处去寻找国耻吗？",
      "output_sha256": "d0ef3d9bd3b8662594a0f707f176347f008171ef15a9a938851c610e2a58d73b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 78,
      "alignment_score": 0.617857,
